Package: c4
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ACTIVESYS <activesys@sina.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.28), libstdc++6 (>= 6.0.25)
Description: C4 AI agent (MCP service cluster + Node.js agent + web frontend)
 C4 is an AI agent for industrial data servers. It bundles a cluster of six
 MCP services exchanging data over POSIX shared memory, a Node.js agent
 (with its own bundled Node.js runtime), and a static web frontend.
